Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: airoha: include buffered GDM4 LAN egress

Describe the GDM4 extension of the existing board opt-in. Keep the DT
property name for compatibility with existing board descriptions.
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-eth.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-eth.yaml
@@ -78,8 +78,9 @@
     description:
       The attached DSA switch has slower user ports whose burst traffic can
       exhaust the SRAM hardware-forwarding descriptor queue. Select the DRAM
-      descriptor queue for DSA destinations while retaining PPE hardware
-      forwarding. Direct GMAC and wireless destinations are unaffected.
+      descriptor queue for DSA and direct GDM4 LAN destinations while
+      retaining PPE hardware forwarding. WAN, other GMAC and wireless
+      destinations are unaffected.
 
   airoha,npu:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
